.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_2026092813428_f8b8ada8-fe37-48ce-b09b-f943132d0b06.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_20260928268115_1659726b-ef5d-4352-acd1-bd5de53ef6ea.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_20260928213432_604e1871-8c8e-438a-9171-bd25980808da.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_20260928341147_b6fe37b1-9844-4bd4-8cc2-d4ab7e4e686b.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_20260928426538_8bc1184f-4121-40f3-8ca1-85f3732dbe0e.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609281761910_2eff5eb1-d47c-4bb7-998d-db9ab1e7e19d.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609281758926_2254f66a-c40e-403d-aadb-b5351839843c.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609281709341_fa35cbeb-e360-40b4-b0e9-d0cd0a2b2217.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_20260928185603_3ce54bcb-f126-43c1-9f78-20f9f682f90c.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_20260928209827_8a58b064-a8e1-41df-8808-aa906ad33982.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609282039116_a3534115-c3d5-4797-b196-8125cae80e1f.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609282009424_6461febd-b115-4baa-9a5c-0adedfc2b5d3.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609282064845_fc791f65-9eef-4845-a950-39f14b218183.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_20260928216074_4f0878d5-1858-4f1a-9188-9203be423503.png","name":"image.png"},{"url":"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609282185118_922ffa56-5af3-4617-a14c-f4549ce77e71.png","name":"image.png"}],"body":"▶해결방법주의: 마그네트론을 교체할 경우, 에어 호스를 사용하여 냉각수 회로의 물을 빼십시오. \n1. 교체 부품 및 준비 공구\n \n2. 검은색 커버 분리\n2.1. 고정 조(jaw)를 분리하십시오.\n \n2.2. 나사 4개를 분리하십시오.\n \n2.3. 덮개를 닫으십시오. [화면의 Close(닫기) 버튼]\n \n2.4. 너트를 분리하십시오.\n \n2.5. 검은색 커버를 분리하십시오.\n \n3. 고정 나사를 풀고 왼쪽 커버를 분리하십시오.\n주의: 이 단계에서 전원을 차단해야 합니다. \n4. 드라이버를 사용하여 전원공급장치에 연결된 배선 4개를 분리하십시오.\n \n5. 드라이버를 사용하여 전원공급장치 주변의 나사 5개를 분리하십시오.\n \n6. 전원공급장치 아래쪽에서 마그네트론으로 연결되는 케이블을 분리하십시오.\n   (안쪽으로 손을 넣어 분리하십시오.)\n여기까지 완료하면 전원공급장치를 분리하여 교체할 수 있습니다.\n이하의 마그네트론 교체 작업을 진행하기 전에 냉각수 회로의 잔수를 빼십시오.\n \n7. 뒤쪽 커버의 모든 나사와 팬 케이블을 분리한 다음,\n   뒤쪽 커버를 분리하십시오.\n \n \n8. 지지판의 나사 3개를 분리하십시오.\n \n9. 플라이어로 케이블 타이를 절단하고 냉각수 밸브를 분리한 다음,\n   지지판을 분리하십시오.\n \n \n10. 마그네트론의 나사 4개와 냉각수 배관 2개를 분리한 다음,\n     마그네트론을 꺼내어 교체하십시오.\n \n▶상세 정보· 없음\n \n▶문제 발생 이유· 없음 \n#태그","author":"송민규","date":"20260928164709","editedDateTime":"20261008101526","status":"대기","url":"https://flow.team/l/Qu5jc"},"assets":{"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609285961432_7e4029fe-95da-4ca9-ac8a-09c2c13dd23b.png":"images/7bf5f79d0ec8099a755e60d345ebf7e158f2e1a32d07cb7ce3c209afa0a523bc.png","https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609285962442_dd05d342-999f-4641-b21b-03ad1cc0e540.png":"images/f3b72a73082a5464a7777ff396ac4aebf538cc0a5cb9256c9c496e6f40e848f6.png","https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_2026092801011_95b17a44-66f6-4199-9047-47ca296c8def.png":"images/7cd1d4e1e960922482db6af456d0487f0fd44fbfd49b533ebfa588668e6c5a91.png","https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_2026092813428_f8b8ada8-fe37-48ce-b09b-f943132d0b06.png":"images/75dce8f906544b1ad005011584eaea4f963f489e025e876380f08bc88c2e5a55.png","https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_20260928268115_1659726b-ef5d-4352-acd1-bd5de53ef6ea.png":"images/646cd7ab1e8d1d6a18f04ab34803ba3e212af9e1993afefb3c2a2e7c361f902f.png","https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_20260928213432_604e1871-8c8e-438a-9171-bd25980808da.png":"images/4b6c13de598463cf1a4bea15fe1cc69ab36e8d9070aad14db0f2f7acfab28c34.png","https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_20260928341147_b6fe37b1-9844-4bd4-8cc2-d4ab7e4e686b.png":"images/0fa9a4b66f2c5024fede5bfeab501339b393d6266b412c30026d794eb0643f88.png","https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_20260928426538_8bc1184f-4121-40f3-8ca1-85f3732dbe0e.png":"images/ae0bbde299f0bd53f11482eecf02e2088f2b3ba163944c934